        <mxCell id="c108" value="A service with another protocol version answers ProtocolMismatch and the UI says to install the same Pitcrew version for both. Requests such as Start or Restart go over a fresh hello-request-response connection (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;ServiceClient&lt;/span&gt;), not this stream." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#17181C;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#555A65;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="1454" width="760" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
